{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104087","id":2392097734,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6OlIPG","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104087","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104087.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104087.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104087","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104087/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104087/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104087/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/9d3c950b5d3e95064c334d928f317ad71aff9ad5","number":104087,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"OpenXR: Clean-up `OpenXRExtensionWrapper` by removing multiple inheritance and deprecating `OpenXRExtensionWrapperExtension`","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"~~This builds on PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101951 so marking as DRAFT until that one is merged~~\r\n\r\nRefactors as I described in a [comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101951#issuecomment-2688441647) on that PR:\r\n\r\n1. **Merge the methods from `OpenXRCompositionLayerProvider` up into `OpenXRExtensionWrapper`.** While using `OpenXRCompositionLayerProvider` like a C#/Java/PHP/etc `interface` makes sense, multiple inheritance in C++ can cause weird issues especially in conjunction with Godot's `Object` and `ClassDB` system. In the past we had a really hard to debug crash (see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/88613) that was the result of this, and I personally think it would be better to avoid the problem entirely by just not using multiple inheritance. (Also, we had some later work that attempted to follow the example of `OpenXRCompositionLayerProvider` and my review was \"let's not do that anymore\" because of these issues, but I worry that future contributors may still see `OpenXRCompositionLayerProvider` and again try to follow its example, so let's just get it out of there)\r\n2. **Deprecated `OpenXRExtensionWrapperExtension` in favor of just using the now-exposed `OpenXRExtensionWrapper`.** We can do this without breaking compatibility by just making the default implementations of the virtual methods on `OpenXRExtensionWrapper` use the GDExtension implementations from `OpenXRExtensionWrapperExtension`, and emptying out `OpenXRExtensionWrapperExtension` but not removing it. Old GDExtensions would still extend `OpenXRExtensionWrapperExtension` and continue working fine, but newer GDExtensions could directly extend `OpenXRExtensionWrapper`. This will eliminate the annoying extension-extension we have in `OpenXRExtensionWrapperExtension` :-)\r\n\r\n**NOTE:** This is 100% backward compatible! I tested it with the \"Meta Composition Layers XR Sample\" from the asset library, which includes the binaries for version 3.1.2 of the godot_openxr_vendors extension.\r\n\r\n~~(Although, CI is going to complain about missing methods, but they moved up to a parent class which is fine - I'll copy the messages into the ignore file after CI gives them to me :-))~~","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":865585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"cl